<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Feb 1-15 palm oil exports 203,609t-SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Feb 1-15 palm oil exports 203,609t-SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for February 1-15 at 203,609 tonnes against 255,320 in January 1-15.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 60,032 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 95,373 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 17,950 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products were 30,254 tonnes.</p>
</text>
